{
  "slug": "artist:astral-projection",
  "name": "Astral Projection",
  "editorial_article": "Formed in Tel Aviv in 1993, Astral Projection developed into a central force in the Goa and psychedelic trance scenes through their professional sound studio opened in 1995. The group initially operated as SFX in 1989, a duo consisting of Avi Nissim and Lior Perlmutter that achieved a hit with the 1991 single \"Monster Mania.\" Following a period where Lior Perlmutter spent time in the United States, the group reformed and released material through their label Trust in Trance Records. Their 1995 album Trust in Trance 2 attained the number two position on the Israeli best-selling album charts. Known for tracks like \"Kabalah,\" \"People Can Fly,\" and \"Mahadeva,\" the group has maintained an extensive international touring schedule alongside their discography. In 2012, they collaborated with TIP Records for the release of their \"One\" EP. More recently, the duo expanded their reach with a 2025 album, \"For All Mankind,\" issued via Iboga Records.",
